Package: ember
Title: Reactive Notebooks for R
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Jonathan", "Chen", email = "jonathanwchen@pm.me", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A reactive notebook engine for R in the style of Pluto.jl.
    Cells are read statically into a dependency graph, so editing a cell
    reruns the cells that depend on it.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: later, processx
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
